{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 71,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER071.YBC",
      "sha256": "f924823f07fc2b477af0bceab126559a6d100d5c42213fba34bb20675d8d9ecc",
      "text_count": 205,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 214,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "……這是沒辦法逃避的宿命嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 264,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "再一次想起來吧，那悽慘的雪原呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 286,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "那些引燃地獄火焰的貝爾鐸可勞魔法師呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 312,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 352,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "就像妳曾經經歷過的那些苦難，\n妳也要讓那些人也嘗到一模一樣的經歷。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 380,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "想起那個誓約、那些話語、那遺憾的心情、\n那冰冷的土地、還有那暴風雪咆哮的聲音。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 414,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "我沒辦法……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 448,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "那麼，這一切就會將妳吞噬。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 482,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "……我知道。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 504,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "但是，我沒有辦法認同。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 538,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "失去了朋友跟家庭，我曾經感覺，\n在這世界上，\n已經沒有任何值得我留戀的事物了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 564,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 602,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "但就在那個時候，我遇見了凱洛特，\n遇見了瑟希莉絲、遇見了大家，\n然後遇見了希里鄔司。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 624,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "為什麼，我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 650,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "就算如此，我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 672,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "神哪……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 694,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "如果你真的存在的話，你真是殘酷呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 728,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "妳要好好掌握住自己的靈魂呀……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 750,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "難道妳想被吞噬嗎！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 784,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "那樣也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 812,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "我已經對什麼都不留戀，\n怎麼樣都沒有關係了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 846,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "不可以！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 868,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "不可以這樣就放棄了自己的靈魂呀！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 896,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "就算在那冰封的大地上，\n也不要放棄綻放妳的意志呀！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 918,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "北壁的雪花呀，妳怎麼了！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 952,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "她已經死了……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 974,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "我啊，我沒有辦法對希里鄔司復仇……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 996,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "沒辦法復仇……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1024,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "我曾經希望要有這樣的覺悟，就算要捨棄我所\n有珍視的東西，那也沒有關係。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1050,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1076,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "但是，我終究沒辦法做到呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1104,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "無論是怎樣的誓願也好，\n現在都是如此地薄弱。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1126,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "我已經沒辦法再綻放出什麼了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1188,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "夏朧……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1250,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "羅沙麗亞……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1272,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "妳，難道……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1334,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "帕彌菈，把希里鄔司帶過來。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1362,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            47,
            48
          ],
          "text": "只有希里鄔司，\n才是解開夏朧身上咒縛的關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1424,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "夏朧的，咒縛！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1458,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司正是她的第一步。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1486,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "從遙遠的北壁帶著誓願而來的可憐少女，\n她的復仇計畫裡值得紀念的第一步……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1548,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1582,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "她一直都活在向一切復仇的誓言中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1604,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "快點。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1632,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "如果讓她繼續陷入黑闇中的話，\n就再也沒有機會讓她恢復囉！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1694,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            58
          ],
          "text": "不，不用了，這樣就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1728,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "什麼……！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1762,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "妳究竟在慌張些什麼？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1790,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            61,
            62
          ],
          "text": "難道，\n妳沒有聽見這個可憐小女孩的心願嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1816,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1854,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            64,
            65,
            66
          ],
          "text": "在僅僅八歲的時候，就被奪走了父母，\n失去了兄長，失去了妹妹，\n失去了在雅斯斐斯的所有同胞。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1892,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            67,
            68,
            69
          ],
          "text": "白銀的城市被貝爾鐸可勞的火焰包圍，\n民宅被軍靴踐踏摧毀，\n結實纍纍的田地被毫無遺漏地蹂躪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1942,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            70,
            71,
            72,
            73,
            74
          ],
          "text": "求救的呼喊在空中虛弱無力地掙扎，\n然後消散，對著賢者們訴說他們的遺憾，\n與那苦澀大地的冷漠。\n在紛飛的冰屑中，一個人茫然地泣訴，\n哭泣著，嘶吼著。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 1974,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            75,
            76
          ],
          "text": "就算如此，她也沒有放棄生存，\n最後來到了這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2036,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "夏朧……！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2070,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            78
          ],
          "text": "那故鄉被業火燒盡的痛苦，妳忘記了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2098,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            79,
            80
          ],
          "text": "連在那萬念俱灰的生活中，\n深刻在心中的痛苦，妳也忘記了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2124,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2150,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "這簡直就是你的寫照不是嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2178,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            83,
            84
          ],
          "text": "這個小女孩的經歷，\n正在重蹈你過去人生的覆轍。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2210,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            85,
            86
          ],
          "text": "我有說錯嗎！\n德涅西亞‧露弗鐸可勞！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2272,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "你這傢伙……！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2306,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "以我黑衣施咒者之名……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2328,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            89
          ],
          "text": "當妳遵守誓約的時候，幫助妳復仇。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2350,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            90
          ],
          "text": "當妳毀棄誓約的時候，則給予妳永久的咒縛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2412,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            91
          ],
          "text": "……烏洛波羅斯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2446,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "雖然令人哀傷，但她沒辦法完成復仇的心願。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2468,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "差那麼一點點，就連誓約都要被破壞了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2496,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            94,
            95
          ],
          "text": "到時候，我會將那恐怖的黑色咒語灌注到她身\n體裡，讓她就此魂飛魄散。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2518,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            96
          ],
          "text": "就要在這北壁的雪花能夠完全綻放之前……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2580,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            97
          ],
          "text": "父親……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2642,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "老師！！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2704,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            99
          ],
          "text": "呃……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2766,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "是要遵守誓言，走向復仇的道路呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2794,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            101,
            102
          ],
          "text": "還是要放棄誓約，讓自己的身心都墮入黑闇，\n受到那永久的咒縛所控制呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2822,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            103,
            104
          ],
          "text": "無論妳選擇哪一個方向，\n那都是朝向地獄的道路，再也不能回頭了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2848,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            105
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2880,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            106,
            107
          ],
          "text": "無論要花多久的時間，\n至少就讓妳好好地掙扎一下吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2902,
          "speaker_id": 130,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            108
          ],
          "text": "然後就讓妳在那無可改變的結局中沉睡吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 2964,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            109
          ],
          "text": "夏朧！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3026,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            110
          ],
          "text": "唔……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3080,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            111
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3134,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3244,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            113
          ],
          "text": "平靜下來了嗎……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3294,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            114
          ],
          "text": "是的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3316,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            115
          ],
          "text": "她現在睡得很熟。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3338,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            116
          ],
          "text": "這孩子現在就跟她剛到這裡的時候一樣……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3364,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            117
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3426,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            118
          ],
          "text": "那所謂的黑衣施咒者……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3448,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            119
          ],
          "text": "以前曾經被稱為學舍的七哲之一？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3494,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            120,
            121,
            122
          ],
          "text": "愛爾梅納斯在極大的混亂中逮捕了他們，\n而在那之後，\n他們就被關入了不見天日的牢獄中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3516,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            123
          ],
          "text": "那是我才二十六歲時候的事情了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3542,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            124
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3574,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            125,
            126
          ],
          "text": "那是我身為熾天使的羽翼，\n總是莽撞戰鬥的時代。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3608,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            127,
            128,
            129
          ],
          "text": "原來這孩子遇到了他呀。\n從虛無之中，\n將混沌召喚到這愛爾梅納斯的黑衣施咒者呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3670,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            130
          ],
          "text": "……不會吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3710,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            131,
            132
          ],
          "text": "趁著愛爾梅納斯陷入了混沌之中，\n準備實現多年來一直策劃著的復仇嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3744,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            133
          ],
          "text": "竟然有這樣的事情……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3766,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            134
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3800,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            135
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3822,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            136
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3852,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            137
          ],
          "text": "……抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3878,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            138
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3900,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            139
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3964,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            140,
            141
          ],
          "text": "只要用我的生命交換，\n就可以拯救夏朧了對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 3998,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            142
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司，你……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4024,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            143
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4070,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            144
          ],
          "text": "……現在暫時是那樣的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4092,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            145
          ],
          "text": "但是，只有這樣是沒辦法完全解決問題的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4120,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            146,
            147
          ],
          "text": "那北壁的誓約，\n是要將你們整個家族血脈都完全斷絕的誓言。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4154,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            148
          ],
          "text": "如果夏朧曾經經歷過那樣痛苦的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4176,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            149
          ],
          "text": "那麼，現在就是輪到我的時候了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4238,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            150
          ],
          "text": "冷靜點，希里鄔司。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4278,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            151,
            152
          ],
          "text": "…………\n我要把我的生命獻給她。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4300,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            153
          ],
          "text": "雖然妳說那不能完全解決問題。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4322,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            154
          ],
          "text": "但是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4344,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            155
          ],
          "text": "那對我來說一點也不重要。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4406,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            156
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4440,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            157
          ],
          "text": "別阻止我！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4462,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            158
          ],
          "text": "我已經說了是我自己想要這麼做！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4496,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            159
          ],
          "text": "呼～～～！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4530,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            160
          ],
          "text": "對，怎樣都可以，怎樣做都沒關係啦！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4552,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            161
          ],
          "text": "你也是個賢者對吧！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4574,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            162
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4608,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            163,
            164,
            165
          ],
          "text": "那滿溢的詠月之泉可以映照人的內心，\n從那白皙城砦的深處，\n可以潛入這少女內心的黑闇之中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4630,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            166
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4688,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            167
          ],
          "text": "詠月之泉……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4722,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            168,
            169,
            170
          ],
          "text": "為了要斬斷咒縛的根源，\n而必須到那個地方的人，\n通常已經沒有太大的希望了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4744,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            171
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4802,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            172
          ],
          "text": "要對付像黑衣施咒者這麼老練的敵人……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4824,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            173
          ],
          "text": "您認為這些孩子們做得到嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4898,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            174,
            175,
            176
          ],
          "text": "…………\n為了一個不知道本性如何的孩子，\n就要賭上全體純潔之盾的安危嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4920,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            177
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 4942,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            178
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5010,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            179,
            180
          ],
          "text": "不管是誰都好，\n不管事情到底是怎樣都好！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5038,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            181,
            182
          ],
          "text": "難道大家不是一起在愛爾梅納斯共同生活的同\n伴嗎！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5060,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            183
          ],
          "text": "我想要幫助她……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5094,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            184
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5156,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            185
          ],
          "text": "在夏朧破壞了她心中的誓約之前。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5224,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            186,
            187
          ],
          "text": "如果這樣就能夠拯救她的話，\n要做什麼我都願意。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5264,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            188,
            189
          ],
          "text": "我們能做的，只有埋葬那個以烏洛波羅斯為根\n源的黑闇。至於是否能克服那誓約的咒縛，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5286,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            190
          ],
          "text": "就要看夏朧自己了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5314,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            191,
            192
          ],
          "text": "如果她的心靈能夠聽進朋友的話語，\n那麼也許還有機會。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5354,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            193,
            194
          ],
          "text": "…………\n至少肯定會比什麼都不做要好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5376,
          "speaker_id": 7,
          "speaker": "羅沙麗亞",
          "text_indices": [
            195
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5410,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            196,
            197,
            198
          ],
          "text": "……我瞭解了。\n我們要拯救夏朧，\n要驅逐那佔據夏朧心靈的混沌。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5444,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            199
          ],
          "text": "是！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5466,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            200
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5524,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            201
          ],
          "text": "是的……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5586,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            202
          ],
          "text": "是！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5648,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            203
          ],
          "text": "瞭解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 71,
          "source_offset": 5710,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            204
          ],
          "text": "加油吧！"
        }
      ],
